 "change_log": null, "created_date": 1773059650, "id": "34210641335217897", "version": "0.2.33", "version_code": 492, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 20}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "28320567507558672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "34163676146581083"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1008249534449753"}]}, "change_log": "v0.2.32 New Acherito Lake Environment and Improved Browser\n\n\u2022 New in Plus: Acherito Lake, a calm mountain lake beneath jagged limestone peaks in the Pyrenees\n\u2022 New environment browser with multiple pages and easier access to your environments, with downloaded ones shown first\n\u2022 Fixed a bug from the previous version that could stop voice commands working in Plus\n\u2022 Bonus free weekly environment now changes on Saturdays\n\u2022 Weeks with 3+ sessions now run from Saturday to Friday\n\u2022 My Journey now tracks mindful time in Soul Retreat instead of goal days\n\u2022 Choosing \u201cAlways Bright\u201d in Adaptive Daylight now correctly resets the environment to daytime\n\u2022 Relaxation check in benefits, including better personalisation and mood tracking, are now explained more clearly, and some users may be asked again\n\u2022 Eligible users may now be prompted to \u201cLeave a Quick Rating\u201d, with a Never Ask Again option\n\nQuestions, feedback, or bug reports are always welcome. Email support@soulretreat.app or join the Discord from Profile under Connect and Support.", "created_date": 1772822414, "id": "34163676146581083", "version": "0.2.32", "version_code": 490, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binar